                                            <div class="about">
                                                <h2 class="about-animal">About</h2>
                                                <div class="text-animal">
                                                    <div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW171254536 BCX0">
                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Chimpanzees are highly intelligent and social apes, and considered our closest living relatives.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>                          

                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Each chimpanzee has unique physical features, including variations in skin colour, hair coverage, and facial structure, just like humans. 
                                                                They have opposable thumbs and toes, allowing them to grip tools effectively. Their long arms facilitate 
                                                                'knuckle walking' and climbing, while their strength aids in navigating through the forest canopy.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="Paragraph SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Groups are led by an alpha male who maintains order, resolves conflicts, chooses feeding sites, and has priority in mating. 
                                                                Grooming is essential for bonding in chimp communities, much like handshakes or hugs in human interactions.
                                                            </span>
                                                        </p>
